ar and bumpy roads with ease  and take on off-road passages pretty  safely even when things get a bit rocky  [Music]  Suzuki has definitely fulfilled its  promises Michelle its off-road abilities  mean the SX 4s cross gets you where you  want to go fast on the road or  cross-country  you

